Package: ARTPpval
Title: Fast and accurate P-Value Calculation for Adaptive Rank Truncated Product Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sarah", "W", email = "sarahyyw0123@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for accurate and efficient p-value calculation
    for rank truncated product and adaptive rank truncated product tests,
    including integral approximation, cross-entropy importance sampling
    methods and UFI.
